	//
	// EnergyConsumptionDetails represents information related to the energy
	// efficiency of a product that consumes energy. The information that can
	// be provided is based on international regulations such as for example
	// [EU directive 2017/1369](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2017/1369/oj)
