	// Some but not all Observations represent a [[QuantitativeValue]].
	// Quantitative observations can be about a [[StatisticalVariable]], which
	// is an abstract specification about which we can make observations that
	// are grounded at a particular location and time. Observations can also
	// encode a subset of simple RDF-like statements (its observationAbout, a
	// StatisticalVariable, defining the measuredPoperty; its observationAbout
	// property indicating the entity the statement is about, and [[value]] )
