	// came from a different time or place. (An 'original' image with
	// inaccurate text would generally fall in this category.) For an
	// [[AudioObject]] to be 'missing context': Unaltered audio presented in an
	// inaccurate manner that misrepresents it. For example, using incorrect
	// dates or locations, or sharing brief clips from a longer recording to
